<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed on Tuesday in active trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 10.91 to 8187.54.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.03 to 492.96.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.10.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 1595 to 1236.</p>
<p>Volume was 525,661,800 compared with 455,995,140 on Monday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
